      "duration": 2.803,
      "end": 908.307,
      "english": "and eat it at Cheonggyecheon.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 908.307,
      "duration": 4.771,
      "end": 913.078,
      "english": "I was going to eat a sandwich, but I discovered a gimbap place.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 913.078,
      "duration": 3.737,
      "end": 916.8149999999999,
      "english": "It looks really good, so I’ve changed what I’m going to eat.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 916.982,
      "duration": 1.001,
      "end": 917.983,
      "english": "Gimbap!",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 918.884,
      "duration": 5.472,
      "end": 924.356,
      "english": "4,000 won, 5,000 won, up to 6,000 won. They’ve got a variety of prices.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 925.157,
      "duration": 2.436,
      "end": 927.5930000000001,
      "english": "I choose you!",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 928.027,
      "duration": 0.901,
      "end": 928.928,
      "english": "Hello.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 928.928,
      "duration": 1.267,
      "end": 930.195,
      "english": "I’ll take one of these.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 930.195,
      "duration": 2.403,
      "end": 932.5980000000001,
      "english": "Will you be eating it here? / No. I’m taking it to-go.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 932.598,
      "duration": 0.567,
      "end": 933.165,
      "english": "Okay",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 939.338,
      "duration": 2.869,
      "end": 942.207,
      "english": "Goodbye. / Thank you.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 942.207,
      "duration": 3.904,
      "end": 946.111,
      "english": "I got my gimbap to-go and came to Cheonggyecheon.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 946.111,
      "duration": 1.702,
      "end": 947.813,
      "english": "I’m going to eat it here.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 949.682,
      "duration": 4.07,
      "end": 953.7520000000001,
      "english": "Gyeongbokgung, Gwanghwamun Square, and Cheonggyecheon.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 953.752,
      "duration": 1.969,
      "end": 955.721,
      "english": "They are all close together.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 955.721,
      "duration": 6.406,
      "end": 962.127,
      "english": "So it’s really great to take a walk and look around like this.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 962.127,
      "duration": 2.503,
      "end": 964.63,
      "english": "There are a lot of company buildings nearby,",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 964.63,
      "duration": 5.372,
      "end": 970.002,
      "english": "so you can see a lot of office workers eating lunch and talking strolls too.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 980.379,
      "duration": 3.203,
      "end": 983.582,
      "english": "The name of what I’m eating is Edam cheese gimbap.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 983.582,
      "duration": 1.969,
      "end": 985.551,
      "english": "What’s Edam cheese?",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 985.551,
      "duration": 2.002,
      "end": 987.553,
      "english": "Is it a type of cheese?",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 987.553,
      "duration": 2.769,
      "end": 990.322,
      "english": "The cheese flavor’s got a little saltiness.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 990.322,
      "duration": 5.939,
      "end": 996.261,
      "english": "Cheonggyecheon is great both in the daytime and at night.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 996.261,
      "duration": 3.504,
      "end": 999.765,
      "english": "It’s also great for both walking around or just sitting and talking.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 999.765,
      "duration": 2.903,
      "end": 1002.668,
      "english": "Something not so great about Cheonggyecheon is",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1002.668,
      "duration": 3.67,
      "end": 1006.338,
      "english": "there are a lot of bugs here because it’s by the water.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1007.606,
      "duration": 2.102,
      "end": 1009.708,
      "english": "But they’re really tiny bugs.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1009.708,
      "duration": 2.303,
      "end": 1012.011,
      "english": "(Stay away from my gimbap!)",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1012.011,
      "duration": 2.902,
      "end": 1014.913,
      "english": "They say this used to be a road.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1014.913,
      "duration": 3.971,
      "end": 1018.884,
      "english": "Right now, water flows like this,",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1018.884,
      "duration": 4.438,
      "end": 1023.322,
      "english": "but in the past,they say it was a road where cars passed through.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1023.322,
      "duration": 3.503,
      "end": 1026.825,
      "english": "The water was flowing under the road.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1027.893,
      "duration": 2.202,
      "end": 1030.095,
      "english": "The road’s been completely removed,",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1030.095,
      "duration": 3.437,
      "end": 1033.532,
      "english": "and now you can see Cheonggyecheon,",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1033.532,
      "duration": 4.938,
      "end": 1038.47,
      "english": "so I think that’s nice.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1038.47,
      "duration": 2.002,
      "end": 1040.472,
      "english": "Only one or two months from now,",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1040.472,
      "duration": 3.871,
      "end": 1044.343,
      "english": "you won’t be able to go outside and eat food like this because it’ll be cold.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1045.778,
      "duration": 4.304,
      "end": 1050.082,
      "english": "you've got to go out often while the weather’s good.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1051.417,
      "duration": 0.6,
      "end": 1052.0169999999998,
      "english": "(CLEAN)",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1054.553,
      "duration": 3.904,
      "end": 1058.457,
      "english": "Oh… a pigeon is flying around.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1058.457,
      "duration": 2.769,
      "end": 1061.226,
      "english": "Eat some of the bugs, pigeon.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1061.226,
      "duration": 2.203,
      "end": 1063.429,
      "english": "Please eat a lot of bugs for me.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1063.429,
      "duration": 3.236,
      "end": 1066.6650000000002,
      "english": "Everyone, please let me know ",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1066.665,
      "duration": 4.171,
      "end": 1070.836,
      "english": "if you had fun watching today’s video and if it’s helpful for studying Korean.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1070.836,
      "duration": 2.502,
      "end": 1073.338,
      "english": "Also, please click the ‘Like’ button, and leave some comments.",
      "korean": null
    },
    {
      "start": 1073.338,
      "duration": 2.403,
      "end": 1075.741,
      "english": "I’ll keep trying to take more videos like this one too.",
      "korean": null
    },
